                <div className="about-overview-content">
                    <span className="about-overview-eyebrow">Who We Are</span>
                    <h2 className="about-overview-title">Who We Are</h2>

                    <div className="about-overview-copy">
                        <p>DizitalAdda, operated by DA DigitalAdda Innovations Pvt. Ltd., is one of India's most reviewed skill training institutes, based in Greater Kailash II, New Delhi. We specialise in career-oriented courses in Digital Marketing, Generative AI, Machine Learning, Data Science, Data Analytics, and Cyber Security &amp; Ethical Hacking.</p>
                        <p>We were founded in 2009 with a single belief: that practical, industry-connected training — not classroom theory — is what actually gets students hired. Over the past 16 years, that belief has not changed. What has changed is the scale: we have now trained 25,000+ students and working professionals from across India and placed them at companies including Flipkart, Nykaa, Myntra, Growisto, Performics, Dentsu, and 250+ other organisations.</p>
                        <p>We operate in a corporate campus environment in South Delhi, with small batches of maximum 15 students per cohort, so every learner receives direct mentor attention rather than being lost in a crowd. Our trainers are not academic instructors — they are full-time industry professionals who manage live campaigns, real budgets, and active client accounts every day.</p>
                        <p>We are recognised by the Government of India's Skill India and Digital India programmes, and our certifications are co-branded with Google, Meta Blueprint, HubSpot, and Semrush - credentials that every recruiter in India recognises.</p>
                    </div>

                   
                </div>
