                    <p className="about-why-card-copy">Every cohort at DizitalAdda is capped at 15 students. This is a deliberate policy - not a logistics constraint. It means every student receives direct trainer feedback, gets their doubts resolved in class, and completes the same hands-on projects that real agencies handle for paying clients.</p>
