                    <p className="about-why-card-copy">Our syllabi are reviewed and updated every quarter in line with Google algorithm changes, Meta Ads platform updates, and the latest AI tools entering the market. When ChatGPT reshaped content marketing, our curriculum included Prompt Engineering within 60 days. When AI Overviews changed SEO strategy in 2024, we added AEO and LLMO modules before most institutes had even acknowledged the shift.</p>
