                    <p className="about-why-card-copy">Students at DizitalAdda do not run mock campaigns on fictional accounts. They work on live brand accounts - running actual Google Ads, optimising real websites for SEO, managing live Meta Ads budgets, and building real-world WordPress sites. Your portfolio when you graduate is a record of actual results, not screenshots of sandbox exercises.</p>
