                    <p className="about-why-card-copy">Our Placement Team works with 250+ companies across Delhi NCR, pan-India, and remote roles. The process includes resume building, LinkedIn profile optimisation, portfolio review, mock interviews, and direct company introductions. We do not consider our job done when you complete the course - we consider it done when you are employed.</p>
